{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/900939-granting-numinas-or-influences","id":900939,"title":"Granting numinas or influences","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-27T07:27:58-07:00","id":900939,"title":"Granting numinas or influences","content":"If a spirit, after a successfull bargain, grants the use of either one of his numinas or influences to his summoner (mortal or otherwise), would lose the use of it until the end of the pact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T08:37:30-07:00","id":901007,"title":"","content":"Depends, I'd say. I could see it as either &quot;here is the spiritual trick I use/I'm granting you provisional access to the same source of power&quot; or &quot;I'm bestowing you with a piece of my power - use it well&quot;. Up to the ST. If you want, you could make some divide like low Rank ephemerals lose access (since they don't have a bunch of power to throw around), while high Rank ones can just grant access. Or maybe it depends on the recipient - if they already have &quot;spiritual power&quot;, teach them a new trick doesn't cost the patron, while giving a mundane human Blast, Aggressive Meme, or Influence: Fire 4, necessitates breaking off that part of the donor's power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 05-27-2016, 11:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T13:46:13-07:00","id":901337,"title":"","content":"You can simplify the process by giving these spirits the <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/626202-new-numina\">Grant Blessing Numen</a></b> and house ruling that each spirit can bestow a maximum number of Numina and/or Influence dots equal to Rank or Rank x 2 or something, which can be divided among multiple summoners as determined by the bargains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T15:23:57-07:00","id":901452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/900939-granting-numinas-or-influences?p=901337#post901337\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can simplify the process by giving these spirits the <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/626202-new-numina\">Grant Blessing Numen</a></b> and house ruling that each spirit can bestow a maximum number of Numina and/or Influence dots equal to Rank or Rank x 2 or something, which can be divided among multiple summoners as determined by the bargains.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like it, but I would change &quot;hours&quot; for &quot;days&quot;regarding the blessing duration.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T03:51:10-07:00","id":904073,"title":"","content":"Closest I can recall to rules for that is demonic pact making, which is done through a numen, I don't recall them giving out influences though.<br /> <br /> If one wanted to use that as a basis, then no, the spirit wouldn't lose out on any numina they gave out, but the mortal keeping the numen for longer periods would require higher payment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}